/emu_*.png
scripts/vehicle/*.png
scripts/vehicle/doorA_*.txt
scripts/vehicle/doorB_*.txt

# Vehicle drive telemetry (nav_log CSV + cluster screenshots) — road-name column reveals the
# owner's real commute route (location PII); the repo is public/OTA. Keep raw logs LOCAL only.
# Aggregate analysis lives in docs/diagnostics/*.md (no route), which IS committed.
docs/diagnostics/nav-logs/

# Shelved old release/vehicle-test builds — kept locally, NOT committed (closeout 1.30).
